{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "見所斷因法（dassanenapahātabbahetuka-dhamma），是依見道所斷有因法之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001002", "type": "orig", "text": "非見非修所斷因法（nevadassanena-nabhāvanāya-pahātabbahet uka-dhamma），是見道所斷因與修道所斷因皆無之法，亦含無因法；不可解為見道修道所不斷之有因法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "修所斷因法（bhāvanāyapahātabbahetuka-dhamma），是於修道即一來、不還、阿羅漢道，所斷有因法之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本為 dassanenanabhāvanāya，係 nevadassnenanabhāvanāya 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0006001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0006001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本之「見非修」以改訂之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之「見非修所斷因法」者如是改正，疑俱行癡相應之三蘊是見所斷因法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「修所斷」以訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011002", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「修所斷」以訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0022001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0022001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本為「修所斷因」，以如是訂正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0026001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0026001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「修所斷因法」以訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「非見非修所斷因法」以訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052001", "type": "orig", "text": "是指意根至具知根之十四非色根與非色之命根等之非色十五根，為相應故。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062001", "type": "orig", "text": "積集趣法（ācayagāmi-dhamma）是趣向於生死輪迴之善惡法。亦意譯為流轉法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062002", "type": "orig", "text": "非積集趣非減滅趣法（nevācayagāmi-nāpacayagāmi-dhamma）是與生死、解脫無關之無記法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063001 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "減滅趣法（āpacayagāmi-dhamma）謂導生死解脫之聖道。亦意譯為還滅法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本雖作「積集趣」，應是誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本闕如，然依善三法而插入。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本雖有「積集趣」，是誤排。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「積集趣」，今改正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093001", "type": "orig", "text": "於底本有「積集趣」，今訂正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0306001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0306001", "type": "orig", "text": "除去水界而外之地、火、風之三大種。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0335001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0335001", "type": "orig", "text": "註幹（Aṭṭhakathā-kaṇḍa）者是法集論註釋 aṭṭhasālini 之別名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0063a0201", "type": "add", "text": "南傳大藏經此處註標[02]有誤，今予以修訂為[＊]。"}
